  - linear matrix inequality
  - interval arithmetic
abstract: >-
  JAX tools for curvature, energy conditions, and geodesics in prescribed
  spacetimes. Includes Hawking-Ellis classification, numerical LMI tests,
  observer optimization, exact checks for supplied rational certificates,
  interval enclosures on supported domains, and source-consistency diagnostics.
  Finite-segment energy integrals and grid diagnostics carry explicit limits.
